  "semantic_fragments": [
    {
      "fragment_type": "scope_limitation",
      "content": "This product is a high-tech infra-red (IR) thermometer designed to take human body temperature by measuring the energy of IR emitted from the forehead. The product will help you to assess you and your family members' health conditions easily and quickly.",
      "topic_tags": [
        "infrared thermometer",
        "forehead temperature",
        "intended use",
        "IR technology"
      ],
      "related_subjects": [
        "PT9L",
        "Infrared Forehead Thermometer"
      ]
    },
    {
      "fragment_type": "behavioral_spec",
      "content": "The risk management activity including the risk management plan was began at the time the project is approved. The risk management plan has defined the acceptance criteria of risk, and has also arranged the risk management review activity. The risk management group is established to ensure the risk management activity of the current project will be implemented effectively according to the risk management plan. On the development phase and prototype phase of the Infrared Forehead Thermometer, the risk management group reviewed the risk management respectively, and documented the risk management files. The objective of this review is to take a complete evaluation on risk management activity performed on each phase before the product is marketed, to ensure that the risk management plan has been accomplished. And according to evaluating the risk analysis, risk assessment and control, and the acceptance of the residual risk, to ensure that all the risks has been managed and all the residual risk can be accepted.",
      "topic_tags": [
        "risk management plan",
        "risk acceptance criteria",
        "risk management review",
        "residual risk",
        "development phase",
        "prototype phase"
      ],
      "related_subjects": [
        "PT9L-FXJH01",
        "PT9L-FXPJ01",
        "PT9L-FXYS01"
      ]
    },
    {
      "fragment_type": "constraint_statement",
      "content": "Risk acceptance criteria: Please find the document Risk Management Plan (PT9L-FXJH01 V1.0) for the risk acceptance criteria.",
      "topic_tags": [
        "risk acceptance criteria",
        "risk evaluation criteria"
      ],
      "related_subjects": [
        "PT9L-FXJH01 V1.0"
      ]
    },
    {
      "fragment_type": "behavioral_spec",
      "content": "Review on Production and after Production: Please refer to 'Table of getting information of Production and after Production' from the Risk Management Control Methods (Version: E/0). After the evaluation on the fitness and effectiveness, the risk management Group decided that, the method is appropriate and effective, PT9L can get the information on production and after production with this method, and the Group can perform dynamic risk management when necessary.",
      "topic_tags": [
        "post-market surveillance",
        "production information",
        "dynamic risk management"
      ],
      "related_subjects": [
        "PT9L",
        "Risk Management Control Methods"
      ]
    },
    {
      "fragment_type": "design_rationale",
      "content": "Conclusion of Risk Management Review: (1) All the risks in the Risk Analysis Report have been identified, evaluated and controlled. (2) The residual risk after the implementation of the risk control measure is already within the acceptable scope. (3) The benefit to patient from using the product: The Infrared Forehead Thermometer based on IR technology can quickly measure the human body temperature and help user to judge the body temperature. The benefit from using the product is greater than the residual risk. (4) The information gathered in production and after production: the risk management Group has established a method to collect information in production and after production, by collecting and processing the information, the group can perform the dynamic risk management when necessary. (5) Based on all the above, the risk management Group considers that the Risk Management Plan has been completed and all the residual risks are acceptable.",
      "topic_tags": [
        "risk management conclusion",
        "residual risk acceptance",
        "benefit-risk",
        "risk control",
        "post-market"
      ],
      "related_subjects": [
        "PT9L",
        "PT9L-FXJH01 V1.0",
        "PT9L-FXPJ01 V1.0",
        "PT9L-FXYS01 V1.0"
      ]
    },
    {
      "fragment_type": "scope_limitation",
      "content": "The Intended use of PT9L is: The Infrared Forehead Thermometer is intended for the intermittent measurement of body temperature from the forehead skin surface on people of all ages. It can be used by consumers in the household environment and by healthcare providers.",
      "topic_tags": [
        "预期用途",
        "体温测量",
        "红外额温计",
        "PT9L",
        "家用",
        "医疗专业人员"
      ],
      "related_subjects": [
        "PT9L"
      ]
    },
    {
      "fragment_type": "design_rationale",
      "content": "Risk Management Group has reviewed the PT9L, and concluded the following:\n——Risk management plan has been performed properly: The risk management process has been implemented according to the criteria established in the risk management plan standards, the risk team have considered the efficiency and safety of the product, and think that all the identified risks have been controlled as far as possible.\n——Residual risks are acceptable: All single residual risks are in the 'Acceptable' area. And the distribution of all the residual risks less than 1/2 of the overall residual risks are in the higher severity regions or in the higher probability regions. And the clusters of all the residual risks are not borderline. Compared with the intended benefits for PT9L, the benefits outweigh the overall residual risks, So the overall residual risks are also acceptable.\n——The method of getting information of production and after production is proper.\nIn Conclusion, the medical benefits of the intended use outweigh the overall residual risk.",
      "topic_tags": [
        "风险管理评审结论",
        "剩余风险",
        "风险可接受性",
        "风险收益分析",
        "PT9L"
      ],
      "related_subjects": [
        "PT9L",
        "风险管理计划"
      ]
    },
    {
      "fragment_type": "behavioral_spec",
      "content": "From the clinical evaluation report, we can conclude: clinical safety outcomes can prove that the product is safe; clinical performance outcomes can prove that PT9L can achieve its intended use. Users can benefit from proper use, benefits outweigh the overall residual risks, so the overall residual risks are acceptable.",
      "topic_tags": [
        "临床评价",
        "临床安全性",
        "临床性能",
        "剩余风险",
        "PT9L"
      ],
      "related_subjects": [
        "PT9L",
        "临床评价报告"
      ]
    }
  ],
